    summary: "Trump says settlement with Iran possible US President Donald Trump said on Monday that a settlement with Iran \"could happen\". In a post on Truth Social, Trump wrote, \"Oil Prices are DROPPING LIKE A ROCK, down almost $10 a Barrel, A RECORD, because people feel that there will not be a War with Iran.\" \"Iran wants a settlement, as soon as possible. It could happen,\" he added.",
